  "definition": "Data Requirements for Each Deal of Electronic Lucky 7 Tickets",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-03-22",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Lot 7100) #13068, eff 6-27-20#13913, eff 3-22-24 (formerly Lot 7108.03)",
